{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1790670540, "covers_from": "2026-09-29T08:29:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-09-29T08:30:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1790670600, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-09-29T08:29:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "queue_number": 53369, "sprite_key": "turtle_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "食安", "content": "簡淑培議員應該要去修正食品中毒的相關法令，而不是一直從情感層面，繼續指責教育局，徒增中間選民的反感。", "display_name": "大安代表 No.53,369", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": false}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-29T08:29:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 4338, "sprite_key": "turtle_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "食安", "content": "我覺得很多市場的食物都很好吃。但是角落環境都很髒。外國朋友其實都覺得有點難適應。能夠有可能清乾淨嗎？", "display_name": "大安代表 No.4,338", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-29T08:29:30+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 16169, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "環境", "content": "我希望台北是一個清潔整齊的首都。不希望看到鼠蟻蟑螂橫行。希望排水系統可以繼續加強不要一下雨就淹大水。", "display_name": "大安代表 No.16,169", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-29T08:29:45+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 29920, "sprite_key": "squirrel_suburb", "district": "beitou", "topic": "交通", "content": "推廣背包背在胸前，可以讓公共交通車廂內更多空間，稍微延長捷運車廂開門時間，可以讓大家安心到站下車", "display_name": "北投代表 No.29,920", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 4338, "sprite_key": "turtle_culture", "display_name": "大安代表 No.4,338", "district": "daan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 16169, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "display_name": "大安代表 No.16,169", "district": "daan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 3, "queue_number": 29920, "sprite_key": "squirrel_suburb", "display_name": "北投代表 No.29,920", "district": "beitou", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 4, "queue_number": 24616, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_oldtown", "display_na